m/wiki/File:KPTOT41_BanzoGrowth.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/5b/KPTOT41_BanzoGrowth.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20250502082350","caption":"Внешний вид добрый и вежливый! Официальная тренировка Tenshitchi","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/5b/KPTOT41_BanzoGrowth.png/revision/latest?cb=20250502082350"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:KPTOT53_ChubbyAngel.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/3/33/KPTOT53_ChubbyAngel.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20250503044631","caption":"Из альбома «Chubby Angel» · № 18","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/3/33/KPTOT53_ChubbyAngel.png/revision/latest?cb=20250503044631"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:KPTOT54_ChubbyAngelKiss.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a7/KPTOT54_ChubbyAngelKiss.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20250503044717","caption":"Из альбома «Chubby Angel» · № 19","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a7/KPTOT54_ChubbyAngelKiss.png/revision/latest?cb=20250503044717"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:KPTOT55_ChubbyAngelPray.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/66/KPTOT55_ChubbyAngelPray.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20250503044738","caption":"Из альбома «Chubby Angel» · № 20","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/66/KPTOT55_ChubbyAngelPray.png/revision/latest?cb=20250503044738"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:KPTOT81_Angels.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f2/KPTOT81_Angels.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20250503073204","caption":"Из альбома «Chubby Angel» · № 21","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f2/KPTOT81_Angels.png/revision/latest?cb=20250503073204"},{"file":"https://tama